# left half of the banner relettered: the traced "KING'S" strokes (blue, plus their
# light grey halos) have been taken out and "PAINT" is lettered in their place.
# "QUEST" and everything else is the traced original, so the picture matches the
# reference pixel for pixel outside the left half's lettering. The commands are
# regrouped so it paints the ribbon, then the title the way KQ1 letters it (both
